  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Todd Chaffee is an American venture capitalist who built his career financing technology businesses. A former Visa executive, he established its venture investment programme before joining IVP as a general partner. Raised in Minnesota, he became known for backing internet and travel companies, including Twitter, and also founded the adventure-travel company Grand Expeditions.",
    "html": "<p>Todd Chaffee is an American venture capitalist who built his career financing technology businesses. A former Visa executive, he established its venture investment programme before joining IVP as a general partner. Raised in Minnesota, he became known for backing internet and travel companies, including Twitter, and also founded the adventure-travel company Grand Expeditions.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 53,
